oaching ..", "options": ["allow passage if there are no vehicles from front side.", "no preference need be given.", "the driver shall allow free passage by drawing to the side of the road"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “the driver shall allow free passage by drawing to the side of the road” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 33, PDF page 3", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-035", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Red traffic light indicates ..", "options": ["vehicle can proceed with caution.", "stop the vehicle.", "slow down."], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “stop the vehicle.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 35, PDF page 3", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-037", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Parking a vehicle in front of entrance to hospital", "options": ["Proper", "Improper", "Proper if NO PARKING sign is not provided"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Improper” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 37, PDF page 3", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-041", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Overtaking is prohibited in following circumstances", "options": ["when it is likely to cause inconvenience or danger to other traffic", "when the vehicle in front is reducing speed", "during night"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “when it is likely to cause inconvenience or danger to other traffic” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 41, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-043", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Overtaking when approaching a bend", "options": ["is permissible", "not permissible", "is permissible with care"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “not permissible” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 43, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-045", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Drunken driving", "options": ["allowed in private vehicles", "allowed during night time", "prohibited in all vehicles."], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “prohibited in all vehicles.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 45, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-049", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Rear view mirror is used", "options": ["for seeing face", "for watching the traffic approaching from behind", "for seeing the back seat passenger"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “for watching the traffic approaching from behind” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 49, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-051", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Boarding in and alighting from a vehicle while in motion", "options": ["Permitted in bus", "permitted in autorikshaw", "prohibited in all vehicles"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “prohibited in all vehicles” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 51, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-055", "category": "rules", "prompt": "When fuel is filled in a vehicle", "options": ["shall not check air pressure", "shall not smoke", "shall not use any light of the vehicle"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “shall not smoke” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 55, PDF page 4", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-057", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Mobile phones shall not be used", "options": ["in Government offices", "in Police Stations", "While driving a vehicle"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “While driving a vehicle” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 57, PDF page 5", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-059", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Overtaking is prohibited", "options": ["When the road ahead is not clearly visible", "when the road ahead is wide enough", "when the road center is marked with white broken lines"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “When the road ahead is not clearly visible” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 59, PDF page 5", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-061", "category": "rules", "prompt": "The pedestrians shall not cross the road at sharp bends or very near to a stopped vehicle. Why?", "options": ["Inconvenience to other vehicles.", "Inconvenience to other road users.", "Drivers of other vehicles coming at a distance may not see persons crossing the road."], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Drivers of other vehicles coming at a distance may not see persons crossing the road.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 61, PDF page 5", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-065", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While turning to a road to the left of the road in which you are going, you should", "options": ["Show the left turn signal, drive to the center and turn to the left", "Sound horn and turn to the left", "Show the left turn signal, keep to the left side of the road and turn to the left."], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Show the left turn signal, keep to the left side of the road and turn to the left.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 65, PDF page 5", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-069", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While you are driving with the head light in high beam during night, a vehicle approaches from opposite direction, you will", "options": ["Proceed keeping to the left", "Put the head light in dim and bright alternatively several times", "Dim the head light till the vehicle passes"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Dim the head light till the vehicle passes” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 69, PDF page 5", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-075", "category": "rules", "prompt": "When you see the traffic sign School, you should", "options": ["Stop the vehicle, sound horn and proceed.", "Slow down and proceed with caution", "Sound horn continuously and proceed"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Slow down and proceed with caution” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 75, PDF page 6", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-079", "category": "rules", "prompt": "The Signal while taking U- turn", "options": ["Left turn signal", "Right turn signal", "Slow down signal"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Right turn signal” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 79, PDF page 6", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-085", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Before overtaking a vehicle, it should be ensured that …..", "options": ["No vehicle is approaching from behind", "The road ahead is clearly visible and it is safe to overtake", "The vehicle in front is turning left."], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “The road ahead is clearly visible and it is safe to overtake” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 85, PDF page 7", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-089", "category": "rules", "prompt": "When your vehicle is being overtaken, you should", "options": ["Stop your vehicle and let the vehicle to overtake", "Increase the speed of your vehicle", "Not obstruct the other vehicle from over taking"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Not obstruct the other vehicle from over taking” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 89, PDF page 7", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-091", "category": "rules", "prompt": "A place where parking is prohibited", "options": ["In front of a parked vehicle", "On one-way road", "On foot-path"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “On foot-path” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 91, PDF page 7", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-093", "category": "rules", "prompt": "The hand brake is to be used", "options": ["To reduce the speed", "To apply sudden brake", "To park a vehicle"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “To park a vehicle” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 93, PDF page 7", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-095", "category": "rules", "prompt": "More than two persons on a two wheeler is", "options": ["Allowed in unavoidable circumstances", "Violation of law", "Allowed when the traffic is less"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Violation of law” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/S