take another vehicle.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 119, PDF page 9", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-123", "category": "rules", "prompt": "When our vehicle is being over taken….", "options": ["We shall not increase speed", "We can increase speed", "We can increase speed with due care"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “We shall not increase speed” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 123, PDF page 9", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-125", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Parking is prohibited in the following place…..", "options": ["Entrance of hospital", "Left side of the road", "Market area"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Entrance of hospital” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 125, PDF page 9", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-127", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Parking is prohibited in the following place…..", "options": ["blocking a fire hydrant", "near a public well", "left side of the road"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “blocking a fire hydrant” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 127, PDF page 9", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-141", "category": "rules", "prompt": "When you reach an intersection where there is no signal light or police man, you will…", "options": ["Give way to traffic approaching the intersection from other roads", "Give proper signal, sound the horn and proceed", "Give way to the traffic approaching the intersection on your right side and proceed after giving necessary signals."], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Give way to the traffic approaching the intersection on your right side and proceed after giving necessary signals.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 141, PDF page 11", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-143", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While you are approaching an intersection where the yellow signal light is blinking, you should….", "options": ["As there is no restriction, proceed at the same speed", "Stop the vehicle and wait for the green light to appear", "Slow down the vehicle and proceed only after ensuring that it is safe to do so"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Slow down the vehicle and proceed only after ensuring that it is safe to do so” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 143, PDF page 11", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-147", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While you are driving on gradient roads, you should….", "options": ["Give precedence to the vehicles coming down the hill", "Give precedence to the vehicles going up the hill", "Give precedence to the vehicles carrying heavy load"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Give precedence to the vehicles going up the hill” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 147, PDF page 11", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-151", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While a vehicle entering a main road from a branch road, the driver shall give preference…", "options": ["To the vehicles coming from the left", "To the vehicles coming from the right", "To all vehicles proceeding along the main road"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “To all vehicles proceeding along the main road” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 151, PDF page 11", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-155", "category": "rules", "prompt": "What is \"Tail-gating\" ?", "options": ["Driving too close behind a vehicle in a dangerousmanne r.", "Keeping safe distance from the vehicle ahead regulating the speed proportionately.", "Keeping a distance of atleast 7 metres from the vehicle ahead."], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Driving too close behind a vehicle in a dangerousmanne r.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 155, PDF page 12", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-160", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Road on which driving in reverse gear is prohibited…", "options": ["One-way road", "Steep descending road", "Steep ascending road"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “One-way road” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 160, PDF page 12", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-162", "category": "rules", "prompt": "You hold a learners licence for motor cycle ….", "options": ["You will drive when the traffic is less", "You will drive the vehicle only when an instructor holding driving licence to drive motor cycle accompanies", "You will not carry any other person on the motor cycle except for the purpose of getting instructions from an instructor who holds a valid driving licence to drive motor cycle"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “You will not carry any other person on the motor cycle except for the purpose of getting instructions from an instructor who holds a valid driving licence to drive motor cycle” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 162, PDF page 12", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-164", "category": "rules", "prompt": "All motor vehicles must be covered by….", "options": ["Life Insurance", "Third party Insurance", "Comprehensive Insurance"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Third party Insurance” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 164, PDF page 12", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-165", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Minimum distance to be kept from the vehicle going in front…", "options": ["10 meter", "5 meter", "safe distance according to speed."], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “safe distance according to speed.” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 165, PDF page 13", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-166", "