taking another vehicle” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 316, PDF page 21", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-318", "category": "rules", "prompt": "A driver of a motor car driving behind a long truck can keep a braking distance", "options": ["1.2 meters", "2.5 meters", "safe distance"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “safe distance” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 318, PDF page 21", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-321", "category": "rules", "prompt": "No driver of a motor vehicle shall sound horn on", "options": ["highways", "prohibited areas by notification of the authority", "rural roads"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “prohibited areas by notification of the authority” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 321, PDF page 21", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-322", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Which of the safety device fitted in Light Motor vehicle protects the driver from injury", "options": ["helmet", "Seat belt", "none of above"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “Seat belt” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 322, PDF page 21", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-324", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Pedestrians should walk on the ----------------------side of the road", "