ect answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 336, PDF page 22", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-338", "category": "rules", "prompt": "If your vehicle hits a pedestrian you should", "options": ["identify yourself and leave", "help the person, and call an ambulance", "help the injured for medical aid identify yourself and then report to police"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “help the injured for medical aid identify yourself and then report to police” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 338, PDF page 22", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-339", "category": "rules", "prompt": "You should not over take", "options": ["when the road ahead is not visible", "on straight road", "in rural areas"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “when the road ahead is not visible” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 339, PDF page 22", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-340", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Reversing is prohibited in", "options": ["main road", "in one way", "at T Junction"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “in one way” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 340, PDF page 22", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-341", "category": "rules", "prompt": "While driving on wet or slippery road", "options": ["tyre pressure must 