ad users"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “is an offence and is punishable” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 366, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-369", "category": "rules", "prompt": "You can open the doors on the traffic side(right side) when", "options": ["traffic is clear", "the car stop completely", "after signalling other cars to side"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “traffic is clear” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 369, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-372", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Fitment of a multi toned horn in a vehicle is", "options": ["allowed", "not recommended since it is a costly alternative", "is against law"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “is against law” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 372, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-373", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Flashing yellow traffic light means", "options": ["continue at the same speed", "stop, if possible to do so.", "slow down and proceed with caution"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “slow down and proceed with caution” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 373, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving