 rollers and cranes", "mobile automobile work shop", "ambulance and fire service vehicles"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “ambulance and fire service vehicles” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 378, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-379", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Drivers should not sound horn", "options": ["in one way", "on main road", "at silent zone"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “at silent zone” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 379, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-381", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Mandatory signs are exhibited in", "options": ["circular shape except stop and give way signs", "triangular shape", "rectangular shape"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “circular shape except stop and give way signs” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 381, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-382", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Cautionary signs are exhibited in", "options": ["circular shape", "triangular shape", "rectangular shape"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “triangular shape” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 382, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-383", "category": "rules", "prompt": "Informative signs are exhibited in", "options": ["circular shape", "triangular shape", "rectangular shape"], "answer": 2, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “rectangular shape” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 383, PDF page 24", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-387", "category": "rules", "prompt": "The safe way to stop the vehicle", "options": ["press clutch and then brake", "press brake and then clutch", "press clutch and brake simultaneously"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “press brake and then clutch” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 387, PDF page 25", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-389", "category": "rules", "prompt": "If your vehicle became break down during night", "options": ["stop, use hand brake and exhibit hazardous warning light", "stop and exhibit red light", "leave the vehicle"], "answer": 0, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “stop, use hand brake and exhibit hazardous warning light” as the correct answer.", "source_url": "https://parivahan.gov.in/sites/default/files/DownloadForm/STALL_QB_ENGLISH_NEW.pdf", "source_ref": "Question 389, PDF page 25", "imported_at": "2026-10-23", "topic": "Safe driving"}, {"id": "parivahan-395", "category": "rules", "prompt": "An accident victim can be treated by", "options": ["only a government hospital doctor", "any registered medical practitioner or doctor", "by the driver"], "answer": 1, "image": null, "explanation": "The published Parivahan question bank identifies “any registered medical practitioner or doctor” as t